OL,3,GNEWSAHuman bones found during
OL,4,Arenovation of Ayrshire bandstand
OL,5,
OL,6,FHuman bones have been uncovered during
OL,7,Frenovation work on a bandstand in
OL,8,FAyrshire.
OL,10,FThe discovery were made during work at
OL,11,Fthe Place de Saint-Germain-en-Laye
OL,12,Fbandstand in Ayr.
OL,14,FA picture sent to BBC Scotland News
OL,15,Fshowed several bones lying on the
OL,16,Fground at the site, having been found
OL,17,Fby workmen.
OL,19,FPolice Scotland later attended to
OL,20,Fremove the bones and work has resumed.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
